flowchart TD
    Trigger[trigger / poll / webhook] --> Check{reconciling?}
    Check -->|yes| Pending[set pending, return 202]
    Check -->|no| Flock[acquire flock, non-blocking]
    Flock --> Run[run reconcile once]
    Run --> Drain{pending set?}
    Drain -->|yes| Run
    Drain -->|no| Done[clear reconciling, unlock]
